 "notes": "Strip c: x 3600-5700 plus ~300 px overlap. Middleton Avenue north of Resor is printed only 'AVE.' (name assumed continuous with MIDDLETON printed south of Bryant). Bryant: printed 'BRYANT' west of Middleton and '...AVE.' east of Telford; recorded as Bryant Avenue. Telford printed 'TELFORD' / 'AVE.'. Shilo printed 'SHILO ST.'. Whitfield and Ormond each jog at Ludlow/Howell respectively: recorded as two T junctions. Evanswood Place west and east segments meet Cornell Place ~120 px apart. Dixmyth runs along the plate's bottom edge, its south side cut by the plate edge; bends are midway between block line and plate edge (~+-15 px). A scan crease near x 5380 shifts Dixmyth lines ~30 px. Alleys at x1=3300 continue west beyond the strip. Clifton Avenue lies east of x 6250, outside this strip's overlap."
